{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02897","headline":"和长孙秘监伏日苦热 · 任希古","name":"和长孙秘监伏日苦热","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉署三时晓，金羁五日归。\n北林开逸径，东阁敞闲扉。\n池镜分天色，云峰减日辉。\n游鳞映荷聚，惊翰遶林飞。\n披襟[扬]子宅，舒啸仰重闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任希古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}